      "updated": 1742351808016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hate and bigotry are on the rise, but small everyday actions can push\nback and create a more just, kind, and joyful world. Join this mission\nto make a difference in your community.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hate and bigotry are on the rise, but small everyday actions can push back and create a more just, kind, and joyful world. Join this mission to make a difference in your community.",
